=============================================================================

MedOrbits -- Environment Configuration Template

File: .env.example

Copy to: .env for local development

=============================================================================

SECURITY RULES

1. Never commit .env files, real credentials, private keys, or tokens.

2. Generate independent secrets for every environment.

3. Production secrets must come from the deployment secret manager.

4. Never expose private uploads, temporary files, logs, or backups publicly.

5. Keep payment, AI, SMS, and email integrations disabled until configured.

6. Validate environment variables before starting the application.

7. Never use production services or credentials in automated tests.

8. An environment variable has no effect unless application code reads it.

=============================================================================

--------------------------------------------------–

01. APPLICATION AND SERVER

--------------------------------------------------–

NODE_ENV=development
APP_ENV=development
APP_NAME=MedOrbits
RELEASE_VERSION=1.0.0
DEPLOYMENT_ENVIRONMENT=local

HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=3000
TRUST_PROXY=0

APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:3000
PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
API_PREFIX=/api/v1
API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000/api/v1

APP_TIMEZONE=Asia/Kolkata
APP_LOCALE=en-IN
APP_CURRENCY=INR
PUBLIC_DEFAULT_LOCALE=en-IN
PUBLIC_DEFAULT_CURRENCY=INR
PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME=MedOrbits

APP_SUPPORT_EMAIL=support@example.com
APP_CONTACT_EMAIL=contact@example.com
APP_LEGAL_EMAIL=legal@example.com

MAINTENANCE_MODE=false
STARTUP_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT_MS=10000

--------------------------------------------------–

02. SECURITY AND AUTHENTICATION

--------------------------------------------------–

Development placeholders only. Replace before running any non-local environment.

Generate secrets with:

node -e "console.log(require(‘node:crypto’).randomBytes(48).toString(‘hex’))"

Generate separate values for SESSION_SECRET, JWT_SECRET and COOKIE_SECRET.

SESSION_SECRET=replace_with_unique_random_session_secret
JWT_SECRET=replace_with_unique_random_jwt_secret
COOKIE_SECRET=replace_with_unique_random_cookie_secret

JWT_ISSUER=medorbits
JWT_AUDIENCE=medorbits-users
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL=15m
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL=7d

BCRYPT_ROUNDS=12
PASSWORD_MIN_LENGTH=12
PASSWORD_RESET_TOKEN_TTL_MINUTES=30
EMAIL_VERIFICATION_TOKEN_TTL_HOURS=24

AUTH_ENABLED=true
REGISTRATION_ENABLED=true
EMAIL_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED=true
PHONE_VERIFICATION_REQUIRED=false
MFA_ENABLED=false
ADMIN_MFA_REQUIRED=true

CSRF_ENABLED=true
HELMET_ENABLED=true
CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY_ENABLED=true
TLS_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=true

COOKIE_NAME=medorbits.sid
COOKIE_HTTP_ONLY=true
COOKIE_SECURE=false
COOKIE_SAME_SITE=lax
COOKIE_DOMAIN=

REQUEST_BODY_LIMIT=1mb
JSON_BODY_LIMIT=1mb
URLENCODED_BODY_LIMIT=1mb

--------------------------------------------------–

03. MYSQL DATABASE

--------------------------------------------------–

Use a dedicated least-privilege application account.

Create the database and grant permissions separately.

Do not use a root or administrator account for normal application queries.

DB_CLIENT=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_NAME=medorbits
DB_USER=medorbits_app
DB_PASSWORD=replace_with_local_database_password
DATABASE_URL=

DB_CONNECTION_LIMIT=10
DB_QUEUE_LIMIT=0
DB_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=10000
DB_IDLE_TIMEOUT=60000
DB_WAIT_FOR_CONNECTIONS=true
DB_ENABLE_KEEPALIVE=true
DB_TIMEZONE=Z
DB_LOG_QUERIES=false

DB_SSL_ENABLED=false
DB_SSL_CA_PATH=
DB_SSL_CERT_PATH=
DB_SSL_KEY_PATH=

DB_AUTO_MIGRATE=false
DB_AUTO_SEED=false
DB_MIGRATION_USER=
DB_MIGRATION_PASSWORD=

--------------------------------------------------–

04. REDIS, CACHE AND SHARED STATE

--------------------------------------------------–

REDIS_ENABLED=false
REDIS_HOST=127.0.0.1
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_USERNAME=
REDIS_PASSWORD=
REDIS_DB=0
REDIS_URL=
REDIS_TLS_ENABLED=false
REDIS_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=10000
REDIS_KEY_PREFIX=medorbits:

SESSION_STORE=memory
SESSION_TTL_SECONDS=604800

CACHE_ENABLED=false
CACHE_TTL_SECONDS=300
RATE_LIMIT_STORE=memory

--------------------------------------------------–

05. CORS AND ORIGIN POLICY

--------------------------------------------------–

Use explicit origins separated by commas. Do not use a wildcard with credentials.

CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000
CORS_ALLOW_CREDENTIALS=true
CORS_MAX_AGE_SECONDS=600

--------------------------------------------------–

