12. RATE LIMITING AND ABUSE PREVENTION

--------------------------------------------------–

Memory-backed rate limits are not shared between application instances.

Use a shared store for multi-instance deployments.

RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=true
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=100

AUTH_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
AUTH_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=10

PASSWORD_RESET_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=5
EMAIL_VERIFICATION_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=10

UPLOAD_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
UPLOAD_RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=20

--------------------------------------------------–

