17. ADMIN BOOTSTRAP AND INTERNAL ACCESS

--------------------------------------------------–

Keep bootstrap disabled during normal operation.

Prefer a controlled one-time setup command over a permanent bootstrap route.

BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_ENABLED=false
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_EMAIL=
BOOTSTRAP_ADMIN_PASSWORD=
INTERNAL_API_TOKEN=

--------------------------------------------------–

